wser screenshots, reason: no ObjectStack backend can run here (the ../objectstack checkout has no node_modules or dist, and building one is a full install and build on a shared 4-core box). NOT MEASURED: check:eager-locale-catalogues, reason: PREREQUISITE NOT MET (needs a full console build for apps/console/dist/eager-closure.json). NOT MEASURED: check:readme-exports, reason: exit 1, but all 95 lines say 'type entry not on disk' for unbuilt packages, a prerequisite failure and not a finding.",
