  {
   "question": "When the org context renders in an app (WorkspaceSwitcher for multi-org users, CurrentOrganizationIndicator on single-org walled deployments), it still sits left of the app pill, so the bar's left edge is the org name. The ruling places the pill first but does not place the org context. Should it move?",
   "options": [
    "A: keep it where it is. Zero further change; the common single-org environment shows neither control, so the bar starts with the pill.",
    "B: move the org context to the right-hand cluster in app context only. It is a small AppHeader change, but the org context then sits in different places in app and platform contexts.",
    "C: move it into the avatar menu everywhere. That is a larger change with its own design decision."
   ],
   "recommendation": "A, until the maintainer's staging screenshots show a multi-org environment; it needs no new surface, and B or C is a design call the ruling did not make."
  }
