  "File surface addition: content/docs/guide/console-architecture.md, content/docs/guide/console.md and packages/app-shell/README.md describe exactly the UI this card moves (the sidebar logo header and the Design in Studio entry), and AGENTS.md rule 2 makes docs part of done. These edits are declared in the PR body. Nothing under app-shell/src/environment/ or app-shell/src/console/home/ was touched, and nothing in objectstack.",
